# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# Modified from sentinel-official/dvpn-node @ 62bde16 (2024-01-25). See NOTICE.
.DS_Store*
/bin/
/vendor/

# A contributor's local files stay out by pattern, never by name: Markdown at
# the root is a local note unless it is one of the shared documents below (a
# new one gets its line here), and a dot-directory at the root holds a tool's
# settings or state unless it is .github/.
/*.md
!/README.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/SECURITY.md
!/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
/.*/
!/.github/

# What a node, a test or a tool run can leave in the tree: the node's
# database, keyring, keys and secrets, coverage output, Python's cache.
*.db
keyring-*/
*.key
.env
*.out
__pycache__/

# Rendered architecture diagram and browser-check sidecars (generated; see docs/architecture/README.md)
/docs/architecture/*.html
/docs/architecture/*.png
/docs/architecture/*.visual-check.*
